{"questions":[{"question":"Kva betyr $\\log_a b = x$?","options":["$a^x = b$","$b^x = a$","$x^a = b$","$a^b = x$"],"explanation":"Logaritmen $\\log_a b$ er per definisjon den eksponenten $x$ vi må opphøgje $a$ i for å få $b$, altså $a^x = b$."},{"question":"Kva er $\\log_2 32$?","options":["$5$","$16$","$4$","$6$"],"explanation":"$2^5 = 32$, så $\\log_2 32 = 5$."},{"question":"Forenkle $\\ln 8 - \\ln 2$.","options":["$\\ln 4$","$\\ln 6$","$\\ln 16$","$\\frac{\\ln 8}{\\ln 2}$"],"explanation":"Rekneregelen $\\ln a - \\ln b = \\ln \\frac{a}{b}$ gir $\\ln 8 - \\ln 2 = \\ln \\frac{8}{2} = \\ln 4$."},{"question":"Kva er $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$?","options":["$4$","$\\frac{16}{3}$","$2$","$16$"],"explanation":"$8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$."},{"question":"Korleis kan $\\log_5 7$ skrivast med naturleg logaritme?","options":["$\\frac{\\ln 7}{\\ln 5}$","$\\frac{\\ln 5}{\\ln 7}$","$\\ln 7 - \\ln 5$","$\\ln \\frac{7}{5}$"],"explanation":"Formelen for skifte av grunntal: $\\log_a b = \\frac{\\ln b}{\\ln a}$, så $\\log_5 7 = \\frac{\\ln 7}{\\ln 5}$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"16749f1a1300940c","translatedAt":"2026-06-22T01:38:59.732Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":23,"tm":{"4c186f2e7b8ff43b":"Kva betyr $\\log_a b = x$?","5115eb892ffcce25":"$a^x = b$","d1895661b3267bb3":"$b^x = a$","a7fc1a18959caee6":"$x^a = b$","a7e30064d36ce2fa":"$a^b = x$","c88398e1f923b282":"Logaritmen $\\log_a b$ er per definisjon den eksponenten $x$ vi må opphøgje $a$ i for å få $b$, altså $a^x = b$.","309def96cbcb9eec":"Kva er $\\log_2 32$?","4031943368147517":"$2^5 = 32$, så $\\log_2 32 = 5$.","e76535240066fdce":"Forenkle $\\ln 8 - \\ln 2$.","ddc9ef0cd4279e80":"$\\ln 4$","16786fb1686da84e":"$\\ln 6$","30ecdafa1601b84b":"$\\ln 16$","3853c3abe8a36bd0":"$\\frac{\\ln 8}{\\ln 2}$","114b870e70f8e9a0":"Rekneregelen $\\ln a - \\ln b = \\ln \\frac{a}{b}$ gir $\\ln 8 - \\ln 2 = \\ln \\frac{8}{2} = \\ln 4$.","3cbcc60e3cec397d":"Kva er $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$?","9a774df9fbf65d8f":"$\\frac{16}{3}$","08272